This product carries JAX inference ports of four published structure-prediction
models. Each port lives under `src/foldjax/models/<name>/`, keeps its upstream
module layout, and carries that upstream's own LICENSE and NOTICE beside it.
None of them is an official project of the organisation that published the
original, and no model weights are distributed with this software.

