AlphaFold 3 (https://github.com/google-deepmind/alphafold3) is *not* carried
here. FoldJAX drives an installation you provide, and its model parameters are
released by Google DeepMind under terms that forbid redistribution. FoldJAX
never downloads, converts, or redistributes them. See docs/alphafold3.md and
the upstream WEIGHTS_TERMS_OF_USE.md.

Model weights for every backend are subject to their publishers' own terms,
which are separate from this software's licence.
